---
interface Props {
  total: number;
}

const { total } = Astro.props;
---

<section class="pt-12 pb-10 sm:pt-20 sm:pb-12">
  <p
    class="text-primary dark:text-dark-text text-[13px] font-bold tracking-[0.08em]"
  >
    ARCHIVE
  </p>

  <div
    class="mt-3 flex flex-col gap-8 sm:flex-row sm:items-end sm:justify-between"
  >
    <div>
      <h1
        class="text-dark text-4xl leading-[1.2] font-bold tracking-[-0.04em] sm:text-[44px] dark:text-gray-50"
      >
        끄적끄적,<br />
        <span class="text-muted dark:text-muted-dark">정리 안 된 생각들.</span>
      </h1>
      <p
        class="text-description dark:text-muted mt-5 max-w-115 text-[15px] leading-[1.75]"
      >
        블로그 글이 되기엔 조금 가볍거나, 가볍게 남기고 싶은 이야기. 틀려도 되고
        짧아도 되는 곳이에요.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- 글 수 -->
    <p class="flex items-baseline gap-1.5">
      <span
        class="text-dark font-mono text-[56px] leading-none font-bold tracking-[-0.04em] dark:text-gray-50"
      >
        {total}
      </span>
      <span class="text-description dark:text-muted text-sm">개의 아카이브</span
      >
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
